	},
	{
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=1, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=2, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=3, time=1500},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat010010d"},
		line=1323,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“I shall begin now.”",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"Two of the clock in the afternoon.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"The manager straightens his posture in front of the sleeping Miyaguni.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"And begins his spell of Healing─",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Terrible mighty Oomikami, Thy humble servant beseeches Thee. Bestow of me Thy powers Lordly...”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"His low, rumbling invocation reverberates through the room.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"The manager's voice is so different from usual that it gives me goosebumps.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"“Magicks” are a worldly miracle left only to the Empire, capable of bending the karmic laws of the world with\nOomikami's divine power.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"The manager's hands are bathed in a faint light.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"A dim yet gentle glow, like the light of a firefly.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"Even the mere sight of it somehow sets my heart at ease.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"The manager passes his glowing hands over Miyaguni's wounds.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ngh... nnh...”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"The gunshot wounds, still welling up with fresh blood, slowly but surely grow smaller.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"This sight never ceases to amaze me, no matter how many times I see it.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Ugh... I apologize... This is the most I can do for now.”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"The manager flops down onto his back.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"His chest is heaving like he just ran a marathon, a testament to the strain the magicks placed on him.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Thank you as always for doing this, Manager.”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Don't mention it. I just pray she recovers.”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"Miyaguni passed out the moment she got back from the Imperial Tomb this morning.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"Likely from the combination of extreme tension, relief, and blood loss.",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"After a while, the manager came back from stocking up at the market.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"When I seized him and asked him to treat Miyaguni, it was only seven of the clock in the morning.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"Ever since, he's been healing her, contending with the limits of his physical stamina all the while.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"Thanks to him, Miyaguni's injuries have gotten visibly better.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			{
"By tomorrow, she should be recovered enough to go about her daily life without difficulty.",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"When I asked the manager to heal her, I told him everything.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"His only reaction was a, “Well, no point in doubting her.” I\ncan't tell if he's being admirably trustful or far too credulous for his own good.",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"But at any rate, I owe him yet another great debt.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Honestly, Manager, you're a real lifesav...”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Blergh.”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Manager? Manager, speak to me!”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"I jostle his lifeless, ragdoll body.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Hah! I nearly set off ",
{"ruby", text="the Nether Realm"},
"to Ne no Kuni.” ",
{"/ruby"},
"",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"The manager wipes the sweat off his brow with a cheerful smile.",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"He's going to give me a heart attack one of these days.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“But, Soujin-kun, how do you plan to explain her to Hotori-san?”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“You don't seriously intend on keeping her a secret, do you?”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Of course not.”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If only I had your ability to get along with multiple women at once.”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Stop it. You're making me sound like a philanderer.”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“That's, you know, part of a florist's job.”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“They call it ≪after-service≫ in the language of the Republic.”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What kind of florist is that?”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"But the reality of Koujiya Flowers is that many of our regulars really do come just for the manager.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Do try not to upset Hotori-san too much... But I suppose\nit's irresponsible for me of all people to say that.”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"The manager accepted Miyaguni immediately, but it definitely won't be so easy with Hotori.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"There's a knock at the door.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"That firm yet polite knock could only be from one person.",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Well, I'll be going now!”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Ah!”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"The manager cuts a dashing figure across the room and leaps out the open window.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"We're on the second floor, you know... What a sprightly fellow.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"Well then, time to get on with it.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"I stand up and walk to the entrance.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"When I slide the door open, I'm greeted by a very displeased Hotori.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Soujin, why didn't you answer my e-mail?”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sorry. I was busy.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“For hours on end?”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"Hotori notices Miyaguni.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"Her eyes are clearly asking, “Who's this?”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“She's injured. I'm taking care of her.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I want to introduce you two, but I need to explain a few things to her. Can you please give us some time?”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Well, I guess I don't mind.”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Then I'll call you in about ten minutes.”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"Hotori meekly withdraws.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"I'm sure she'll kill time by chatting with the manager downstairs.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Who's that?”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
"Miyaguni sits up in the futon.",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“A good friend.”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But first, how are you feeling?”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“A lot better.”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I don't remember it all that clearly, but that manager of yours healed me with magicks, right?”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah. I'll introduce you later.”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It would be great if you thanked him yourself.”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Now, to business.”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"I kneel down with my back straight right in front of Miyaguni.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hmm? What's the matter?”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"Miyaguni blinks her eyes in puzzlement.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We need to talk about my friend just now.”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Sure, go ahead.”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Her name is Inou Hotori, the head of House Inou.”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh? By Inou, you mean that Inou?”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yes. She's the Executor of all the warriors.”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"Since time immemorial, warrior society has been led by three houses.",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"Referred to as the Three Founders, they are House Inou, House Maki, and House Sarashina.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"Each house has its own distinct blade arts and its own dojo to pass them down.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"House Inou's dojo is th",
{"ruby", text="Shining Honor"},
"e Myougikan, ",
{"/ruby"},
"House Maki's",
{"ruby", text="Flourishing Valor"},
" the Koubukan, an",
{"/ruby"},
"d House Sarashina's t",
{"ruby", text="Aspiring Purpose"},
"he Shiseikan.  ",
{"/ruby"},
"",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"Almost without exception, all warriors attend one of these dojos from a young age to temper their minds and bodies.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"But even among the Three Founders, House Inou boasts the greatest strength and is the house that produced the Forefather, the progenitor of all warriors.",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"Thus, the head of House Inou has long been considered the Executor of warrior society.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"Even in the Sworn Blades, this arrangement has been carried over.",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hotori and I go way back. She's always taken good care of me.”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You're close with the head of House Inou? Talk about lucky!”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"Miyaguni grins suggestively, probably expecting to get Hotori on board with her plan.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"If only it could be that easy.",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Gonna introduce us, or what?”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I need to prepare you first.”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“There is absolutely no way Hotori will believe in your lineage.”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But House Inou puts fealty above all else, doesn't it?”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yes, which is precisely why her loyalty to Empress Hisui is so firm.”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Without definitive evidence, she'll treat you as a pretender to the throne.”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Meaning?”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“She'll try to kill you.”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"Miyaguni's expression hardens.",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Concealing your identity is our best bet.”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But she's someone very important to you, right?”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I owe her a great debt.”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We trained together in the same dojo, and when I lost my memories, she was the one who took care of me.”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Then I'll spill everything to her.”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Having to keep secrets from her would be hard on you. Am I wrong?”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"I wasn't expecting her to be this considerate.",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“And besides, if I can't win the trust of House Inou, my future isn't looking too bright anyway.”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“One wrong move, and she'll draw her blade.”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“And you'll just sit back and watch?”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"She asks casually, but her eyes are serious.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I will protect you, of course.”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm in good hands then!”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"At my response, she smiles without the slightest hint of worry.",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"I can't betray her expectations.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If she's an Inou, she's probably really strong, isn't she?”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"Miyaguni murmurs to herself behind my back.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I can't even remember the last time I beat her...”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
"Hotori comes immediately after I call her.",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"From the moment she enters the room to the moment she sits on the floor, I can't spot a single opening.",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			{
"She sits facing Miyaguni.",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			{
"Considering the likelihood of Hotori drawing her blade, I sit diagonally to her left.",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"Hotori raises her eyebrows, sensing my tension.",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Nice to meet you. My name is Miyaguni Akari.”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Inou Hotori. Warrior.”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"The two place their hands on the floor and bow.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"Compared to Hotori's neat and proper bow, Miyaguni's is graceful and refined.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"Goes to show the difference in their upbringings.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“House Inou is the most prestigious family out there, isn't it?”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“So people say.”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I met Miyaguni last night.”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“She was caught up in that accident I asked you to look into.”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			{
"Last night, I asked Hotori to investigate the aftermath of that incident.",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			{
"There's a chance Miyaguni and I are still being pursued.",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"But according to the report she e-mailed me, it was resolved as a simple traffic accident.",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Wasn't that a traffic accident?”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It was actually an assassination attempt.”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The target was Okonogi Tokihiko.”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			{
"Hotori's gaze grows sharp.",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I was the one who did it.”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Okonogi killed my mother.”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			{
"Hotori directs her unrelentingly steely gaze at Miyaguni.",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"Miyaguni doesn't flinch.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“My mother was Empress Suou.”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“And I am the Crown Princess of the Empire, the sole legitimate successor to the Imperial Throne.”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			{
"Hotori remains still as a statue.",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"Amid the leaden silence, her lust for steel billows within the room.",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"It would be no exaggeration to say she's already drawn her blade.",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			{
"A weaker-willed person would not even be able to remain standing in her presence.",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"There is no way that someone of Miyaguni's abilities will be able to dodge her opening strike.",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			{
"I'll have to block it...",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			{
"A cold sweat trickles down my spine.",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Your proof that you are the princess?”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Gonna kill me?”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Depending on your answer.”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Think you can manage it?”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"Hotori is silent.",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Any proof?”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“No.”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"Not even an instant passes.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			{
"I repel her lightning-fast quick-draw with a quick-draw of my own.",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			{
"Thrown off its trajectory, Hotori's blade draws a single, thin streak of blood across Miyaguni's shoulder.",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			{
"For a split second, I make eye contact with Hotori.",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“See? Couldn't do it, could you?”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			{
"Miyaguni smirks, unfazed by her shoulder wound.",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			{
"She certainly has guts.",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			{
"So I thought, but she can't fully hide the subtle trembling of her hands on her lap.",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Soujin, stay out of this.”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I believe what Miyaguni is saying.”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Do you have any definitive proof?”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I will find it.”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Are you messing with me?”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			{
"Hotori's hostility grows even further.",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Impersonating the princess is absolutely unforgivable.”",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Then am I a traitor for siding with Miyaguni?”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			{
"Hotori's eyebrows twitch.",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“What happened to putting fealty first?”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That hasn't changed.”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It is why I'm protecting Miyaguni.”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Without any proof?”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Even so, I still believe her.”",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Ever since I lost my memories, I was at a loss for how to live my life.”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I was constantly doubting whether the path I walked was the correct one.”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But as soon as I met Miyaguni, my path was clear. No, you could say I returned to the path I'd long forgotten.”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“And I was the one who led you astray?”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's not what I mean.”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Not a day goes by that I don't remember my debt to you.”",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“That's enough.”",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			{
"Hotori sniffles quietly and sheathes her blade.",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			{
"She stands up as if to refuse any further conversation.",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			{
"I can tell nothing of what she feels behind her mask-like expression.",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			{
"That in and of itself speaks to her deep indignation.",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Inou, wait.”",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Shut up.”",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Next time we meet, I'll kill you.”",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			{
"With our talks at an impasse, Hotori leaves the room.",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			{
"For a while, the two of us can only stare silently at the door.",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Guess I'm not gonna get anywhere without evidence, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hotori's a single-minded sort of person.”",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If she's on your side, you'll find no warrior more devoted than her.”",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll try talking to her again soon.”",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Think you can win her over?”",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll do everything in my power.”",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You know, that baseless bravado only makes me more anxious.”",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“A warrior always puts forth their absolute effort.”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Uh, the problem here isn't your lack of motivation!”",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			{
"After she delivers her objection, she sighs, seemingly having reached some realization.",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Guess I shouldn't be saying that when I'm completely relying on you.”",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Please find a way, Tokita. However you can.”",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Understood.”",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			{
"Even that simple order has me bristling with motivation.",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			{
"Seems like I'm a warrior through and through.",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oh, and thanks for saving me back there.”",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Honestly, I didn't even see her go for her blade.”",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I've dabbled a bit in blade arts myself, so it's a little discouraging.”",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If you ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"could",
{"/font"},
" follow the blade of an Inou, that'd be pretty extraordinary.”",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hehee. I'll take your word for it.”",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			{
"Miyaguni smiles.",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			{
"She can't conceal the fatigue that floats to the surface of her expression.",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			{
"She may have received treatment, but she's still wounded. No wonder she's exhausted.",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Leave Hotori to me. You should focus on getting some rest.”",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah, thanks. I think I'll do just that.”",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			{
"Miyaguni lays down in the futon.",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			{
"Miyaguni wakes up again just after seven of the clock in the evening.",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			{
"As I attend to her, we discuss our plans moving forward.",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			{
"According to her, she arrived in Tenkyo about one week ago.",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			{
"While laying low at cheap inns, she looked into Okonogi and Empress Hisui's whereabouts.",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			{
"The identity she used to register for accommodations was prepared by this “Satonaka” of hers for precisely such occasions.",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			{
"Her fake identity includes a family registry, certificates of residence, academic records, even entire fake addresses, enough to fool any background check.",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			{
"Members of the Imperial Family don't have family names in the first place, so even the name “Miyaguni Akari” is just an alias.",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's customary not to reveal our true names except to family.”",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I've been using this name ever since the war, so it basically feels like my real name by now.”",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			{
"Miyaguni smiles from inside the futon.",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oh, right. Mind calling me by my first name?”",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If we're gonna be working together, it'd be good to act a bit more familiar, don't you think?”",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If that's what you want. And in that case, I'd like you to call me Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You got it...”",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...Soujin?”",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			{
"For some reason, even though she's not the one having her name said aloud, she still turns red.",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What are you blushing for?”",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I've got my own reasons, okay!?”",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			{
"Akari turns towards the window to hide her blushing face.",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oh, that's right. What should we do tomorrow? What does a normal day look like for you?”",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If you're asking about my occupation, I'm a student. And after school, I work at the flower shop downstairs.”",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“A ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"student?",
{"/font"},
" You, a warrior?”",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			{
"She looks me over incredulously from head to toe.",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We lost our status and salary when our profession was abolished.”",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Legally, I'm just an ordinary civilian. It's only natural I'd attend school.”",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I-I mean, I suppose that makes sense, but a warrior going to school? That's still kinda, you know...”",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			{
"Before the war, warriors spent their every waking moment training in the martial arts.",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			{
"It's understandable that this new development doesn't sit well with Akari.",
			},
		},
		[261]={
			{
"But there is a good reason Hotori and I attend school.",
			},
		},
		[262]={
			{
"Hotori's father and chairman of the Sworn Blades, Inou Kokuan-dono, encouraged us to enroll.",
			},
		},
		[263]={
			{
"According to him, attending school with youths from the Republic could prove useful when it comes to eventually fighting them.",
			},
		},
		[264]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Then you're a full-time student on weekdays?”",
			},
		},
		[265]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No, I'm going to drop out immediately. I want to make you my top priority.”",
			},
		},
		[266]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh? Wait, hold up! Don't just decide that all of a sudden!”",
			},
		},
		[267]={
			{
"Akari sits upright in a panic.",
			},
		},
		[268]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I only have two weeks. There's absolutely no time to waste.”",
			},
		},
		[269]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What good will dropping out do, anyway?”",
			},
		},
		[270]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll have more time to find proof of your lineage.”",
			},
		},
		[271]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Also, I want you to see Tenkyo with your own two eyes.”",
			},
		},
		[272]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If you see the state the city is in, you'll understand the futility of your assassination plot.”",
			},
		},
		[273]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's not futile!”",
			},
		},
		[274]={
			{
"She pouts with a sullen expression.",
			},
		},
		[275]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But either way, that's no reason you should quit school.”",
			},
		},
		[276]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Is there a problem?”",
			},
		},
		[277]={
			{
"Akari lets out a deep sigh.",
			},
		},
		[278]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Listen, Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[279]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What?”",
			},
		},
		[280]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You're kinda stupid, aren't you? Not to mention stubborn.”",
			},
		},
		[281]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Is that really so?”",
			},
		},
		[282]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Don't you give me that.”",
			},
		},
		[283]={
			{
"She pokes me in the chest.",
			},
		},
		[284]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm glad you want to give me priority, but take it easy.”",
			},
		},
		[285]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Take it easy? What for?”",
			},
		},
		[286]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“W-Well... Umm...”",
			},
		},
		[287]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I got it! I'll just enroll instead.”",
			},
		},
		[288]={
			{
"She definitely decided that on the spot.",
			},
		},
		[289]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's even more stupid. Why would you want to stand out?”",
			},
		},
		[290]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What's the big idea, calling your lord stupid?!”",
			},
		},
		[291]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Now listen here, you. I've got academic records and everything. Plus, if you want me to learn about the world,\nisn't school a good place for that?”",
			},
		},
		[292]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Indeed. There are Republicans there too. You could learn a lot.”",
			},
		},
		[293]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I definitely wanna know how they feel about their lives.”",
			},
		},
		[294]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You know, 'know thy enemy and know thy self!'”",
			},
		},
		[295]={
			{
"Akari's eyes sparkle with curiosity.",
			},
		},
		[296]={
			{
"Seeing such a girlish expression, I can't help but grin.",
			},
		},
		[297]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What's so funny?”",
			},
		},
		[298]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You're a lively one.”",
			},
		},
		[299]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah, that totally doesn't sound like a compliment.”",
			},
		},
		[300]={
			{
"Akari looks at me with suspicious eyes.",
			},
		},
		[301]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No, no, I'm saying that you're very charming.”",
			},
		},
		[302]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Wh─”",
			},
		},
		[303]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Guh, ouch...”",
			},
		},
		[304]={
			{
"Akari tries to stand up but clutches her side.",
			},
		},
		[305]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You sure are a lively one.”",
			},
		},
		[306]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That one wasn't a compliment either, was it?”",
			},
		},
		[307]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Of course.”",
			},
		},
		[308]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oh, how humiliating!”",
			},
		},
		[309]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Owowowowow...”",
			},
		},
		[310]={
			{
"Akari lies down with a displeased expression.",
			},
		},
		[311]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Well, now we've decided what we're doing starting tomorrow. You should call it a day and rest.”",
			},
		},
		[312]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah, that's probably for the best.”",
			},
		},
		[313]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll be right next to you the whole time. If you need anything, just say the word.”",
			},
		},
		[314]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Now I feel like I'm in even more danger...”",
			},
		},
		[315]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You think a warrior would ever lay a hand on his lord?”",
			},
		},
		[316]={
			{
"A warrior is his lord's blade. Nothing more.",
			},
		},
		[317]={
			{
"For a mere tool to lay a hand on its master would be unthinkable.",
			},
		},
		[318]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Y-Yeah, that figures.”",
			},
		},
		[319]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Anything you wanna say?”",
			},
		},
		[320]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“No, there isn't!”",
			},
		},
		[321]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm going to bed. Sleeping now, got it?!”",
			},
		},
		[322]={
			{
"Akari forcefully dives under the covers.",
			},
		},
		[323]={
			{
"I suspected she was only pretending, but in a matter of minutes, I hear slow, even breathing coming from her futon.",
			},
		},
		[324]={
			{
"She must be relieved now that we have a plan.",
			},
		},
		[325]={
			{
"Tomorrow marks the beginning of my new life together with Akari.",
			},
		},
		[326]={
			{
"Never did I imagine that I'd be attending school alongside the Imperial Princess, but this might be enjoyable in its own right.",
			},
		},
		[327]={
			{
"Now, I'd better make haste and arrange a uniform for her.",
			},
		},
		[328]={
			{
"I begin searching on my tablet computer for clothiers that might still be open.",
			},
		},
